MODULE: ClearanceWasUnreplicatedIgnoresReplication
TARGET: ClearanceWasUnreplicated
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an after-swap undo is cleared even when writes may already be on peers
PERTURBS: UndoClearance

--- FIND
    /\ running /\ undo = "checking" /\ ~replicated /\ alias = "new"
--- REPLACE
    /\ running /\ undo = "checking" /\ alias = "new"
--- END
